; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   916       \COUNTERMEASURE \N The code structure already ensures that the index cannot exceed the size of the array.
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   917     \ID SBSW_DET_2    
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   918       \DESCRIPTION Array Write Access (P6 - Wrong Initialization and Usage of a Pointer due to Wrong Index)
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   919        Initialization of global array in Det_Init. Both the array size and the loop is is controlled by generated #defines DET_*SIZE. 
