; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   928       \DESCRIPTION Function Pointer Call
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   929        Iteration over generated function pointer tables using identifiers generated by the ComStackLib. 
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   930       \COUNTERMEASURE \N Qualified use-case CSL01 of ComStackLib assures correct dimension of arrays and consistency of corresponding size definitions.
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   931        The validity of the callout function names is covered by SMI-5.
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   932     \ID SBSW_DET_6    
; ..\BSW\Det\Det.c	   933       \DESCRIPTION Function Call
